223
00:16:24,416 --> 00:16:25,416
Obrigado, Padre.

224
00:16:26,236 --> 00:16:27,236
Boa noite.

225
00:16:27,238 --> 00:16:28,238
Boa noite, Padre.

226
00:17:03,147 --> 00:17:05,393
<i>A Emma não está bem.</i>

227
00:17:07,167 --> 00:17:09,044
